# NeuroAPI — VS Code REST Client collection
# Set these three, then run top to bottom.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@writeKey = neuro_write_demo_9f2k7q
@readKey = neuro_read_demo_3m8x1z

### 1. Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. List courses (paginated)
GET {{base}}/courses?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Filter + search courses
GET {{base}}/courses?level=beginner&q=rest&limit=5

### 4. Invalid query (limit > 50) -> 400
GET {{base}}/courses?limit=51

### 5. Get one course (replace ID)
GET {{base}}/courses/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 6. Create course — no key -> 401
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "GraphQL in Practice",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "seats": 40,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### 7. Create course — read-only key -> 403
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{readKey}}

{
  "title": "GraphQL in Practice",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "seats": 40,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### 8. Create course — write key -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{
  "title": "GraphQL in Practice",
  "description": "Schemas, resolvers and federation for product APIs.",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "seats": 40,
  "startDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### 9. Create course — past startDate -> 422
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{
  "title": "History Class",
  "level": "beginner",
  "seats": 10,
  "startDate": "2020-01-01"
}

### 10. Create course — bad payload, all errors at once -> 400
POST {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{
  "title": "x",
  "level": "expert",
  "seats": 0,
  "startDate": "yesterday",
  "hacker": true
}

### 11. List learners
GET {{base}}/learners?q=areeba&limit=5

### 12. Create learner — email normalized to lowercase -> 201
POST {{base}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{
  "name": "Zara Iqbal",
  "email": "ZARA.IQBAL@Example.COM"
}

### 13. Create learner — duplicate email -> 409
POST {{base}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{
  "name": "Copy Cat",
  "email": "areeba.shah@example.com"
}

### 14. Create learner — idempotent retry (send twice, same 201)
POST {{base}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "name": "Idem Potent",
  "email": "idem.potent@example.com"
}

### 15. Demo statuses (Status Lab backend)
GET {{base}}/demo/status/200

### 16.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/201

### 17.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/204

### 18.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/400

### 19.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/401

### 20.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/403

### 21.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/404

### 22.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/429

### 23.
GET {{base}}/demo/status/500

### 24. OpenAPI document
GET http://localhost:4000/openapi.json

### 25. Problem page (human-readable)
GET http://localhost:4000/problems/rate-limited

### 26. Wrong method on a known path -> 405 + Allow
PUT {{base}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{writeKey}}

{ "title": "Nope" }

### 27. Unknown route -> 404 problem+json
GET {{base}}/definitely-not-here
